RAW lane=toy:clean B/A=#,#,# AA=#,#,# SLOW=#,#,#
WARM lane=toy:clean round 0 (discarded, not in any median) A/A=# B/A=# AA/A=# SLOW/A=#
PROV end <time> load <load> busy-node [<busy>] quiet-lock <quiet-lock>
